# Rust / Tauri
/target/
dist/
src-tauri/gen/

# The bundled PaddleOCR-json sidecar + models (ticket 31) — ~300 MB,
# fetched from the release archive; never committed. The license
# attribution file IS committed: it satisfies tauri's bundle.resources
# glob (tauri-build rejects an empty match) and rides along in the
# installer, as bundled Apache-2.0 code requires. The old engine and this
# resources folder leave with the pp-ocrv6-sidecar feature's ticket 06.
/src-tauri/resources/paddleocr/*
!/src-tauri/resources/paddleocr/LICENSE-PaddleOCR-json.txt

# The PP-OCRv6 models for the new OCR sidecar (pp-ocrv6-sidecar tickets
# 02/03) — ~190 MB, fetched by packaging/fetch-pp-ocrv6.ps1 from the
# official Apache-2.0 repos; never committed. The license attribution
# file IS committed for the same glob/attributions reasons as above.
/src-tauri/resources/pp-ocrv6/*
!/src-tauri/resources/pp-ocrv6/LICENSE-PP-OCRv6-models.txt

